{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026DqlzhHh8jq1793616444.jpeg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產藍灣半島分行高級資深分區營業經理李偉寧表示，分行新近促成港島東海德園租賃成交，單位為3座極高層C室，實用面積547平方呎，採2房間隔，向東南，享海景，最新以2.9萬元租出，折合實用呎租53元。</p><p> </p><p>李偉寧表示，新租客為外籍夫婦，心儀海德園交通便利，加上為全新物業且對太古地產之物業質素十分滿意，遂決定承租上址，由灣仔區搬遷至港島東區。據了解，業主於今年4月以1,038.6萬元一手購入單位，收樓後迅速租出，現享約3.4厘租金回報。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T10:02:59.259403+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":217,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T09:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T08:38:24.050663+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T09:58:50.687534+00:00","content_hash":"12c989149991cd3aa701a2ffc9064d9fd2ad3af4a3760524d4cfb7f16ab135c2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T10:02:59.259403+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}